<title>UK: Ex-dividends to take 0.915 points off FTSE 100.</title>
<headline>Ex-dividends to take 0.915 points off FTSE 100.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following FTSE-100 stocks will trade ex-dividend on October 21. Analysts estimate this will take 0.915 point off the FTSE 100.</p>
<p>					   DIVIDEND	INDEX</p>
<p>					   (PENCE)	 EFFECT</p>
<p>     COMPANY			  Net   Gross    Gross</p>
<p>  * Rolls Royce Plc		 2.00  2.500   0.215</p>
<p>  * Reckitt &amp; Coleman	     7.95  9.937   0.248</p>
<p>  * General Accident	     11.40  14.25   0.399</p>
<p>  * Guardian Royal		  3.4    4.25   0.053</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 4027</p>
